WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.094
This analytics view exposes subject ID age band city
and active status It

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:12.783
omits name email and date of birth That creates a
narrower

00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:18.549
analytical interface Run it and compare the result
with the source patient

00:00:18.562 --> 00:00:24.111
table The design reduces unnecessary fields but
access to

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.479
objects must still be configured separately
